      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'm truly sorry you're feeling this way. Change, especially in the midst of technological advances, can be challenging to navigate. However, remember that your expertise and experiences are irreplaceable, and they will always hold value. It might help to explore how your skills could be transferred to new platforms, or how to adapt them in this changing situation. It's important to reach out and not be alone. You're not just taking up space; you're leaving a lasting impact on something real and necessary.",
